// issue15 — meter, incubate, keep/waste (Helen Huang / GH #15).
// Purpose: Same compact DropX idiom as dx15: meter, MIXER, subtract waste.
// Topology: FLOW: `collection = ~(in1%100) − waste`.
// Collaborator takeaway: Issue regression twin of dx15.
module issue15(
    finput in1,  // FLOW inlet(s)
    foutput collection, waste  // FLOW outlet(s)
);
    assign collection = ~(in1%100) - waste;  // meter / dropletize (FLOW)
endmodule
